es  should never have occurred in our  society  absolutely wrong people whatever role  they have in government should be able  to  walk on the street walk through the park  unaccosted by  that kind of behavior it should not  happen in a in a free law abiding  society like ours  have you ever used um a private email  account for government business  all business that i conduct goes through  my  private office the information  commissioner  is clear that any key actions and  decisions are  recorded and that's why all government  action that i  conduct takes place through my private  office how i communicate with my private  office  uh is is through a range of measures  including mostly paper through the  through the red box system  so you've never used a private email  account to carry out government business  well i will talk to my private office  through a range of measures you know  phone text  email but the business government  business is conducted  via the private office so that there is  a record of all  key actions and decisions that are taken  uh  all government action you know all  government business takes place through  that office  um how surprised are you that other  ministers  um are not as fastidious as you when it  comes to  carrying out government business well i  think all misses do  they conduct business through their  private office it's it's  it's how you know  i'm sorry talking about private email  accounts as you know and  as we know uh at least two uh ministers  in the department of health have used  their private email accounts  well that's a matter for the department  of health and to  see what your opinion is well the rules  are very clear that  all government action needs to take  place through private offices through  through formal channels so that a record  can be kept of those key  decisions and when there are probably  people do of course have private  conversations  uh and the key thing is that those  private conversations are  communicated to the private office so  that they can then be  if if necessary recorded as part of the  decision making process  do you have a cctv camera in your office  yes  no i don't uh i did ask the question of  course i bet you did  i bet you did um you saw chris bryant  yesterday saying that matt hancock is  the stupidest man on earth um snogging  his mistress in front of a cctv camera  it wasn't the smartest thing to do was  it  well matt hancock has said that he  uh breached the social distancing rules  and as a consequence he felt  that he was head to his island and  that's what happened on  saturday matt hancock has been i think a  very  good uh health secretary he has managed  this  crisis i think the pandemic crisis  exemplary  and we have kept the nhs safe it hasn't  been overwhelmed in that period  and we have them one of the most  successful vaccination rollouts  in the world with 85 percent of adults  now  having had at least one dose and 60  percent of adults having had  two doses so uh i would pay tribute to  matt he  took what he felt was the right decision  to resign  and that decision was accepted by the  prime minister  he also employed his mistress at our  expense  well uh you know i'm a education  minister  uh to be appointed a non-executive  director  there is a process that's uh gone  through with  an appoints appointment commission  commissioner involved i'm sure that that  was the process that happened in the  department of health but i'm not close  enough  to all the details no but she's his  mistress  and we were paying her well  what you want from a non-executive  director is their expertise and  experience  and that's what will have been sought in  the department of health but again i'm  not  close enough to to the process to to  know all the details  okay good to talk to you thanks for  joining us on the program this morning  thank you

